		///         while preserving upgrades and enchantments, as with vanilla starter cards.
		///     </para>
		///     <para xml:lang="zh-CN">
		///         注册 <see cref="T:MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Models.Relics.ArchaicTooth" /> 超越配对。若玩家牌组包含 <typeparamref name="TStarterCard" />，获得该遗物时会将其
		///         转化为 <typeparamref name="TAncientCard" />，并像原版初始牌一样保留升级和附魔。
		///     </para>
		/// </summary>
		/// <remarks>
