		///         Handles the postfix of <see cref="M:MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Timeline.EpochModel.QueueTimelineExpansion(MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Timeline.EpochModel[])" />. When
		///         <see cref="M:MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Timeline.Epochs.NeowEpoch.QueueUnlocks" /> initiated the primary expansion, it unlocks slots for eligible mod
