	///         <see cref="M:MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Models.AbstractModel.TryModifyRestSiteOptions(MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Entities.Players.Player,System.Collections.Generic.ICollection{MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Entities.RestSite.RestSiteOption})" /> 重写中添加此选项。
