	///         <see cref="M:STS2RitsuLib.Networking.Sidecar.RitsuLibSidecarMessageBinding.RegisterForGodotMainLoop``1(STS2RitsuLib.Networking.Sidecar.IRitsuLibSidecarMessageCodec{``0},STS2RitsuLib.Networking.Sidecar.IRitsuLibSidecarSyncProcessor{``0})" /> 注册，否则会在
