				list.Add(new JoinFailureDetailRow(T("row.modelDbHashMode", "ModelDb hash mode"), FormatModelDbHashMode(host.ModelDbHashUsesDeterministicCache), FormatModelDbHashMode(local.ModelDbHashUsesDeterministicCache)));
				list.Add(new JoinFailureDetailRow(T("row.modelDbHash", "ModelDb hash"), host.ModelDbHash.ToString(), local.ModelDbHash.ToString()));
				list.AddRange(BuildModelDbHashModeDetailRows(host, local));
				list.AddRange(BuildSavedPropertyNetIdSortRows(host, local));
				issues.Add(new JoinFailureIssue(JoinFailureIssueKind.ModelDbHashMode, title, description, new <>z__ReadOnlyList<JoinFailureDetailRow>(list)));
			}
		}

		private static void AddVersionIssue(ICollection<JoinFailureIssue> issues, JoinPeerSnapshot host, JoinPeerSnapshot local)
