		/// <summary>
		///     <para xml:lang="en">
		///         Instantiates <c>card.tscn</c> without <see cref="M:MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Nodes.Cards.NCard.Create(MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Models.CardModel,MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Entities.UI.ModelVisibility)" />, so export never competes with the
		///         shared <c>NodePool</c>.
		///     </para>
		///     <para xml:lang="zh-CN">
		///         不通过 <see cref="M:MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Nodes.Cards.NCard.Create(MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Models.CardModel,MegaCrit.Sts2.Core.Entities.UI.ModelVisibility)" /> 实例化 <c>card.tscn</c>，因此导出绝不会与共享 <c>NodePool</c> 竞争。
